T1  - Ensemble-based Convolutional Neural Networks for brain tumor classification in MRI: Enhancing accuracy and interpretability using explainable AI
AU  - Sánchez-Moreno, Luis
AU  - Perez-Peña, A.
AU  - Duran-Lopez, L.
